            event: "branch_if_61",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_62",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("Without the ruby? No. There are none alive today, save perhaps the great Delfador, with the might to again from-naught weave such a seal. _ But the pieces of our shattered spell still linger. With time, it could be repaired."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("We have tried before, nearly to our doom. The attempt brought the full horrors of the undead crashing down upon our humble home, and many perished. Light save them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I understand — alone, you could not defend yourself. But now I am here. I will help you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("You are a blessing, Konrad. With your help, perhaps it is possible."),
          },
          {
