          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("There are only four of us left who have the power to repair the seal. The rest of us — the novices — I entrust into your command."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("Defend our monastery while the seniors and I work. In forty-eight hours’ time our ritual shall complete, and the seal shall be repaired, trapping the undead back underground."),
          },
          {
