      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_67",
        on: "new_turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Moremirmu",
            text: _("The seal shattered, my home imperiled, my friends slain. This is the work of a dozen lifetimes undone."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Moremirmu",
            text: _("Konrad, I am overcome by grief. I am brought to tears. The very foundation of my faith is shaken."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Moremirmu",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Moremirmu",
            text: _("I am sorry. I cannot battle today. I must meditate, and ponder on my emotions."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Ponder your emotions? Moremirmu, I know it’s a shock to see your home in crisis, but we’re about to fight a battle!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Moremirmu",
            text: _("I am a warrior of the Light, Konrad. My Light cannot shine while there within me beats a heart touched by the Dark."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Moremirmu",
            x: 15,
            y: 6,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "stored_s15b_moremirmu",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Moremirmu",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("He’s gone!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_66",
        on: "side_turn_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "Moremirmu",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Moremirmu",
            text: _("Myrilell, how can our magic have weakened so? Where is Sister Tristia, my mentor? What of Brother Percy, keeper of the ancient texts? They should have stopped this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("Dead, both. Fallen to the swelling tide of undead. You have been sorely missed, Moremirmu, away on your quest to spread light across the wider world."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Moremirmu",
            text: _("Dead!? So many dead."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_69",
        on: "branch_if_69",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "status_s15a",
            equals: "completed",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "say_smalltalk",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_70",
        on: "branch_if_70",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "status_s15a",
            not_equals: "completed",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Myrilell, what is this place we now defend? How did you all come to be here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("These hills — now our home — were once a wholly accursed place, blighted by necromancy and consumed by darkness."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("We know not from whence the evil came. Some think the necromancers to be lich-lords, survivors of their invasion from the west; others believe they are stragglers of Ras-Tabahn’s. We only know that centuries ago, the crown sealed them underground with powerful magic."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("Men and women of our order, servants of the Light, have made it our mission to cleanse this place of evil. We built our monastery here to ensure that the darkness never escapes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vinrar",
            text: _("But it’s been decades since the Crown last sent to us men or supplies, and the power of our order has waned. And now even the seal has fallen..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_68",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
