            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Myrilell",
            text: _("The seniors and I must remain here, to continue strengthening our magic and to ensure the undead never again escape. But into your hands I entrust our young mages, and the nascent Light that they nurture within. May they serve you well as you journey on to reclaim your throne."),
          },
